      }
    },
    "清除本机令牌和 GitHub 阅读内容、目录及内存缓存，保留来源链接。本地文件不受影响；撤销令牌本身需到 GitHub 操作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes the local token, GitHub reading content, directory listings, and memory cache. Source links and local files are kept. Revoke the token itself on GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub 授权已失效，请重新保存令牌。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your GitHub credential is no longer valid. Save a new token."
          }
        }
      }
    },
