    "缓存未能完全清理，请重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cache could not be fully cleared. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网络不可用，且此内容尚未缓存。请联网打开一次后再离线阅读。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network is unavailable and this content is not cached. Open it online before reading offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动缓存读过的 GitHub 文章、已列举目录和加载过的图片。断网或限流时使用已有缓存，不下载整个仓库。清空后保留当前页面、来源和授权，未缓存内容仍需联网。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically saves GitHub articles you read, directory listings you open, and images you load. Uses saved copies when offline or rate limited; does not download entire repositories. Clearing keeps the current page, sources, and credential. Uncached content needs a connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "私有缓存按令牌隔离并加密；清除授权会删除对应缓存。本地原文件不复制到缓存。缓存仅保留在本机，不是跨设备同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private cached content is encrypted and isolated by token; clearing authorization deletes it. Local original files are not copied. The cache stays on this device and does not sync across devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
